1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,021
A chat is more than answers.

2
00:00:03,021 --> 00:00:07,478
It holds names, emails and needs, and when it ends it has an outcome.

3
00:00:07,478 --> 00:00:11,757
This video shows the Data Processing and Metrics tab of a profile:

4
00:00:11,757 --> 00:00:16,690
how the assistant collects details while it chats, what it analyzes after the

5
00:00:16,690 --> 00:00:19,840
chat ends, and how it measures its own results.

6
00:00:24,440 --> 00:00:29,250
While a chat runs, data extraction picks out details, such as a name

7
00:00:29,250 --> 00:00:30,940
or an email address.

8
00:00:31,690 --> 00:00:36,924
When the chat ends, post-session processing analyzes the whole conversation:

9
00:00:36,924 --> 00:00:39,350
a summary, an outcome, and more.

10
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:45,657
Over time, metrics tell you whether chats are solved, liked, and worth the cost.

11
00:00:45,657 --> 00:00:48,500
All three are settings of the profile.

12
00:00:52,740 --> 00:00:57,179
Open the profile, and open the Data Processing and Metrics tab.

13
00:00:57,179 --> 00:01:02,713
Session inactivity timeout is how long a chat can be silent before it is closed.

14
00:01:02,713 --> 00:01:05,030
The default is thirty minutes.

15
00:01:05,497 --> 00:01:07,569
Tick Enable data extraction.

16
00:01:07,569 --> 00:01:12,016
The assistant now picks details out of the conversation as it goes.

17
00:01:12,016 --> 00:01:15,306
Extraction check interval is how often it looks:

18
00:01:15,306 --> 00:01:18,047
every this many messages from the user.

19
00:01:18,500 --> 00:01:20,739
Click Add Entry for each detail.

20
00:01:20,739 --> 00:01:25,216
Enter a Name, such as customer email, and a Description that tells the

21
00:01:25,216 --> 00:01:27,160
assistant what to look for.

22
00:01:27,628 --> 00:01:32,333
Allow Multiple Values keeps several values, such as several products.

23
00:01:32,333 --> 00:01:38,668
Updatable lets a later answer replace the value, for example when a customer corrects an email.

24
00:01:42,909 --> 00:01:50,463
Tick Enable post-session processing, and the assistant analyzes the whole conversation after the chat closes.

25
00:01:50,463 --> 00:01:55,389
Closing a chat also starts the AI Chat Session Closed workflow event.

26
00:01:55,854 --> 00:01:58,421
On the Tasks tab, click Add Task.

27
00:01:58,421 --> 00:02:00,790
Enter a Name and Instructions.

28
00:02:00,790 --> 00:02:04,804
The Type Semantic returns free text, such as a summary.

29
00:02:05,313 --> 00:02:11,686
The type Predefined Options picks from a list, such as resolved, escalated or abandoned.

30
00:02:11,686 --> 00:02:16,093
Add each choice with Add Option, a Value and a Description.

31
00:02:16,544 --> 00:02:20,365
The Capabilities tab next to it picks the tools that the assistant may

32
00:02:20,365 --> 00:02:21,774
use while it analyzes.

33
00:02:26,074 --> 00:02:29,541
The metrics need the AI Chat Session Analytics feature.

34
00:02:29,541 --> 00:02:34,485
Enable session metrics collects the numbers for the chat reports, and adds thumbs

35
00:02:34,485 --> 00:02:37,214
up and thumbs down buttons to the answers.

36
00:02:37,669 --> 00:02:42,908
Enable AI resolution detection lets the assistant decide whether each closed chat solved

37
00:02:42,908 --> 00:02:44,579
the problem of the user.

38
00:02:45,045 --> 00:02:49,663
Enable conversion metrics scores each closed chat against your goals.

39
00:02:49,663 --> 00:02:54,035
Click Add Goal, and enter a Name, a Description of what to judge,

40
00:02:54,035 --> 00:02:56,375
and the Min score and Max score.

41
00:03:00,575 --> 00:03:05,260
Extracted details and the results of the tasks appear in the AI reports

42
00:03:05,260 --> 00:03:07,755
of the site, one row for each chat.

43
00:03:08,505 --> 00:03:13,145
They are also available to workflows, which can send the details to another

44
00:03:13,145 --> 00:03:15,035
system, or notify a person.

45
00:03:15,785 --> 00:03:19,944
The analytics fields appear only after the profile is saved as a chat

46
00:03:19,944 --> 00:03:23,105
profile, and only when the analytics feature is on.

47
00:03:25,105 --> 00:03:29,462
Collect the details you need while people chat, analyze the chat when it

48
00:03:29,462 --> 00:03:31,473
ends, and measure the results.

49
00:03:31,473 --> 00:03:32,925
Thanks for watching.

